# Agent Nexus — Desiderio rendering.
#
# Everything the plain set configures still applies (it is a dependency); this
# set only puts a higher-priority plugin template root in front of it, so each
# plugin resolves the Desiderio variant of its Show template. Those templates
# compose the same markup through Desiderio's component collection, so the demo
# inherits the site's tokens, spacing and dark mode instead of only carrying
# Agent Nexus' own frontend CSS.
#
# Add this set on its own — webconsulting/agent-nexus comes with it as a
# dependency. Requires webconsulting/desiderio ^4.1 (a composer "suggest" of
# agent_nexus), whose component collection lives in Resources/Private/Components.

plugin.tx_agentnexus.view.templateRootPaths.100 = EXT:agent_nexus/Resources/Private/Desiderio/Templates/
